the problem with mac nethack 3.0j and system 7.0 is known.  there is
an interim solution that is non-optimal.  it is doubtful that a proper
solution will be implemented for 3.0j being reserved instead for Mac
NetHack 3.1.

at the least, the 3.0j archive will be re-packaged with a warning about
this unfortunate situation.

btw, send a detailed report to nethack-bugs@linc.cis.upenn.edu
(including MacsBug output if you can manage it).

